{title: Tum Bin Jiya Jaye Kaise}
{artist: Chithra Tum Bin}
{key: A}

{c: Verse 1}
[A]Tum [F#m]bin kya [A]hai jeena,
[A]kya [G]hai jeena
[G]Tum bin [A]kya hai jeena
[A]Tum bin [D]jiya jaaye kaise
[G]Kaise jiya [C]jaaye tum bin
[A]Sadiyon se [D]lambi hain raate
[G]Sadiyon se [C]lambe hue din
[A]Aa jaao [G]lautkar tum,
[G]yeh dil [A]keh raha hai...
[A]Phir [C]shaam-e-tanhaai jaagi
[A]Phir yaad tum [E]aa rahe ho
[A]Phir jaan [C]nikalne lagi hai
[A]Phir mujhko [E]tadpaa rahe ho
[D]Phir [E]mujhko tadpaa [A]rahe ho
[A]Is dil me [D]yaado ke mele hai
[G]Tum bin bahut [C]hum akele hain
[A]Aa jaao [G]lautkar tum,
[G]yeh dil [A]keh raha hai...
[A]Kya kya na [C]socha tha maine
[A]Kya kya [E]na sapne sajaaye
[A]Kya kya na [C]chaaha tha dil ne
[A]Kya kya [E]na armaan jagaaye
[D]Kya [E]kya na [A]armaan jagaaye
[A]Is dil se [D]toofaan guzarte hai
[G]Tum bin to [C]jeete na marte hai
